<item>
            <title>[JGVT-4409] Balance Interface: UX</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4409</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Harmonize look and feel of any GxP measurement external action&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;GxP Preparation Balance Measurement&quot; screen should look like this:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7141317/7141317_image-2026-08-07-16-38-01-745.png&quot; height=&quot;404&quot; width=&quot;482&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;what&apos;s related: pH : &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4410&quot; title=&quot;pH Interface: UX&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-4410&quot;&gt;JGVT-4410&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Collapsible panels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/ins&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Show statuses in a collapsible panel (collapsed by default) per topic (eg &quot;Metrology&quot;,&quot;Equipment Status&quot; (non limitative list).
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;summarise statuses with small icons/squares: default view&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7141319/7141319_image-2026-08-07-16-40-37-502.png&quot; height=&quot;92&quot; width=&quot;587&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;expanded metrology (individually)&#160; (mouse click on collapse/expand icon). Does not change collapse status of other collapsible panels (eg &quot;Equipment status&quot;, not limitative)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7141320/7141320_image-2026-08-07-16-41-17-002.png&quot; height=&quot;124&quot; width=&quot;498&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;expanded equipment status (individually) (mouse click on collapse/expand icon) . Does not change collapse status of other collapsible panels (eg &quot;Metrology&quot;, not limitative)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7141323/7141323_image-2026-08-07-16-42-27-294.png&quot; height=&quot;240&quot; width=&quot;532&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Data browsing on table&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/ins&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Enable data browsing features (compact layout, use striped rows) as per spike (&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4372&quot; title=&quot;UX | convert HTML tables to datatables, while maintaining (re)measurement functionality&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-4372&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-4372&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;).
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;sortable:
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;sorting on any column (except for columns containing non-text objects, eg buttons (&quot;Measure&quot;,&quot;Remeasure&quot;):&lt;br/&gt;
ascending - descending - no sorting, &lt;br/&gt;
clearly visualized with an icon&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;dates must be sorted as date, not textual&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;numbers must be sorted numerically, not textual&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;searchable:&#160;
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;a keyword can be provided for a row-based search
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;upon update the filter is applied so it is immediately reflected in the record set.&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;paging
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;a defined number of records is shown in the table&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;a page selector is shown
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;to jump to a defined page,&lt;br/&gt;
by clicking on the page number.&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;to browse 1 page up or down&lt;br/&gt;
icons resemble &amp;lt; resp. &amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;to jump to the first or last page,&lt;br/&gt;
icons resemble &amp;lt;&amp;lt; resp. &amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;a drop down is shown to set paging size: 5 - 10 - 25 - all&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;show pagination information label, eg :&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;Showing 1 to 10 of 24 entries&quot;&#160;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Button functionality to capture balance outcome remains unchanged,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;for &quot;Measure&quot;, &quot;Remeasure&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;The table section must look like this:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7141349/7141349_image-2026-08-07-16-56-37-964.png&quot; height=&quot;318&quot; width=&quot;621&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
