                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; A Signals GxP-experiment with connected balances in the Equipment Hub and a Preparation Sub table using the GxP Balance Measurement external action.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; The user triggers the external action on Preparation Sub table, opens the Balance interface and interacts with the screen.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Statuses are shown in collapsible panels (at least Metrology and Equipment Status), collapsed by default.
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Panels expand/collapse independently.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Collapsed view shows compact status indicators (icons/squares) maintaining it&apos;s source colors (green/yellow/red).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The measurement table supports compact, striped-row browsing:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;no altered content of measurement table&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;with sorting on sortable columns (excluding action-button columns like Measure/Remeasure)
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;sorting states: ascending, descending, none (with clear icon)&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;correct data-type sorting (dates as dates, numbers as numbers)&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;keyword row search with immediate refresh&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;multiple sorting with shift key pressed&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;pagination with:
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;page navigation (page numbers, previous/next, first/last)&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;page sizes: 5, 10, 25, All&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;info label (example: Showing 1 to 10 of 24 entries)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Measure and Remeasure behavior remains unchanged (no regression in outcome capture logic).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
